el{n!}}{(n+1)\\cdot \\cancel{n!}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{n+1} \\\\  & \\le 1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false whereas statement III is true. Since $0\\le L<1$ for all $n\\ge 1,$ we can conclude that the sequence ${a}_{n}$ is decreasing.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257052 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257053 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257054 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257055 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257056 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257057 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257058 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257059 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1041 "selection" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1104 #edb/ref 17592186257056 13194139533864 true] [17592186257051 1110 #uuid "9c7ec8b4-0a9b-5fcb-8280-de4e086351ae" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257052 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257052 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257052 1111 #uuid "fa0a5f21-9f8a-53dc-b0af-1115d94652c5" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257053 1034 "II and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257053 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257053 1111 #uuid "f3351e5e-3f56-53c9-9626-6bb7e6254fae" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257054 1034 "I and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257054 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257054 1111 #uuid "4278e55e-54fe-5930-8a6a-b24bf10e09d5" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257055 1034 "I only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257055 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257055 1111 #uuid "14576f93-39d1-5d0a-a612-b13bf42e327d" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257056 1034 "III only" 13194139