 true] [17592186259221 1113 #uuid "c3b4dcc1-a729-5d5a-b8a6-15ae89af7190" 13194139533864 true] [17592186259221 1145 "Let $f(x)=6\\sqrt{x}+5x-13.$ Let's first calculate the derivative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{'}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6\\sqrt{x}+5x-13) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6{x}^{1/2}+5x) \\\\  & =3{x}^{-1/2}+5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the slope of the tangent at our point is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m={f}^{'}(1)=3(1)^{-1/2}+5=8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the tangent is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-(-2) & =8(x-1) \\\\ y & =8x-8-2 \\\\ y & =8x-10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find where the tangent line intercepts the $x$-axis, we set $y=0$ and solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0 & =8x-10 \\\\ x & =\\frac{5}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point of intersection is $(\\frac{5}{4},0).$" 13194139533864 true] [17592186259222 1000 #edb/ref 17592186259223 13194139533864 true] [17592186259222 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533864 true] [17592186259222 1041 "coordinate-1" 13194139533864 true] [17592186259222 1104 #edb/ref 17592186259223 13194139533864 true] [17592186259222 1110 #uuid "7b5d3fcd-4b36-5c0b-9ad9-b1f29e8bde90" 13194139533864 true] [17592186259223 1034 "\\frac{5}{4}" 13194139533864 true] [17592186259223 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533864 true] [17592186259223 1111 #uuid "3cc48cdd-92e1-5a5d-a827-52e3380a9ae4" 13194139533864 true] [17592186259224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186259225 13194139533864 true] [17592186259224 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533864 true] [17592186259224 1041 "coordinate-2" 13194139533864 true] [17592186259224 1104 #edb/ref 17592186259225 13194139533864 true] [17592186259224 1110 #uuid "cfd7da7e-2de1-55bf-b7cb-7137ccd6f560" 13194139533864 true] [17592186259225 1034 "0" 13194139533864 true] [17592186259225 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533864 true] [17592186259225 1111 #uuid "328e9600-c843-5b0c-adb1-c4f998420594" 13194139533864 true] [1759218625922